        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Services revenues consist of Google advertising as well as Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices revenues.",
        "text_hash": "a969722067e9744a943b0e0edd4afa4b285ef2a443cacec6e5154425ebe554a7",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
