        "ordinal": 419,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google advertising revenues are comprised of the following:",
        "text_hash": "f09cf343ae079b830e1fbcce0ef7b088104e32b60463151c4a7a2beec546a07f",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
